        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Permissions-Policy: gamepad - probably experimental]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28744</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28744"/>
        <updated>2026-01-30T16:17:50.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">Permissions-Policy: gamepad</code> appears to have been removed in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2364557768" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23470" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23470/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23470">#23470</a> for the reasons given in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2364557768" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23470" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23470/hovercard?comment_id=2423659290&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23470#issuecomment-2423659290">#23470 (comment)</a></p>
<p dir="auto">The data is definitely wierd and needs to be looked at again.</p>
<p dir="auto">Specifically,</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>That issues says the permission was added in 62, but in my PR of <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="952418181" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/11770" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/11770/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/11770">#11770</a> it went in at 86 behind a preference.</li>
<li>The comment is that the feature was only supported "on the allow iframe attribute" based on a note that applied only to FF, so would not affect Chrome.</li>
<li>Chrome indicate it was shipped in 103 but I can't find confirmation <a href="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3566388" rel="nofollow">https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3566388</a></li>
<li>Safari asserts to have supported this in tech preview 186 <a href="https://webkit.org/blog/14916/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-186/" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/blog/14916/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-186/</a> but I can't see it in <a href="https://webkit.org/blog/14205/news-from-wwdc23-webkit-features-in-safari-17-beta/" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/blog/14205/news-from-wwdc23-webkit-features-in-safari-17-beta/</a></li>
<li>Not supported in FF, because FF only supports Feature-Policy</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/marcoscaceres/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/marcoscaceres">@marcoscaceres</a> Do you know if this actually did release in Chrome/Safari, and if so, in what versions</p>
<p dir="auto">This falls out of the post <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3763982649" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42544" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42544/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42544">mdn/content#42544</a></p>]]></content>
